      "statement": "Optional LANGSMITH_API_KEY, LANGCHAIN_PROJECT=openwiki, and LANGCHAIN_TRACING_V2=\"true\" env vars enable tracing of the OpenWiki run itself to LangSmith, separate from the OPENWIKI_LANGSMITH_API_KEY* connector credentials used to read trace source data.",
